# CATATAN: File-file berikut TETAP DI-COMMIT karena merupakan bagian dari aplikasi:
# - /public/index.php (Laravel entry point)
# - /public/.htaccess (Apache configuration)
# - /public/robots.txt (SEO)
# - /public/favicon.ico (Site icon)
# - /public/assets/ (Static assets: CSS, JS, images)
# - /public/images/ (Static images bawaan aplikasi)
# ============================================================
